<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Global Marine started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Global Marine started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dillon Read &amp; Co Inc analyst Byron Dunn started coverage of Global Marine Inc with a neutral rating on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 7/16 to 26-1/2 in early trading.</p>
<p>-- Dunn estimates 1997 fully diluted EPS of $1.48 and $1.82 in 1998 and sees the stock trading in the $30 a share range for the rest of 1997.</p>
<p>-- Sees 1997 total revenues of $956 million and EBITDA of $362 million.</p>
</text>
